     "id": "ep107-map-quiz-1",
     "sourceNodeId": "n049",
     "speaker": "narrator",
     "textEn": "\"Nothing on Earth or in Heaven is perfect,\" said Wukong.",
     "textZh": "\"无论是在人间还是在天界,都没有任何事物是完美的,\"悟空说道。",
     "audioRef": "sent_en:\"Nothing on Earth or in Heaven is perfect,\" said Wukong.",
     "audioStart": 192.375,
     "audioEnd": 196.288
    }
   ],
   "question": {
